      "title": "File:Bantry Courthouse Plaque - geograph.org.uk - 504776.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Bantry_Courthouse_Plaque_-_geograph.org.uk_-_504776.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
